    <string name="fsh_help_title">How to Play Fishing</string>
    <string name="fsh_help_text">Catch the most weight of fish. Anglers take turns, one cast each per round.\n\nThere is only one big button. To cast, choose where to fish (tap a column of the lake or use the arrows), then hold the button: the power meter swings out and back. Let go to cast. The farther out you cast, the deeper the water and the bigger and rarer the fish. Reeds, rocks and lily pads hide different fish.\n\nThen wait. Small tugs are only nibbles: stay still. When the bobber plunges and the ! shows, press the button at once to hook the fish.\n\nTo reel in, hold the button to reel and let go to ease the line. Watch the tension bar: too tight and the line snaps, too loose and the fish slips off. When the fish gets ready to pull (a ripple and a warning), let go and give it line.\n\nRelaxed timing, in the game setup, gives you longer to react and gentler fish. With a screen reader on, the button is a switch: tap it on, tap it off.</string>
